t pass 826->1580->14->1682->1045->1460 (steps 10,14,26,29,30; 1460's only in-neighbours are 765 and 1045, step_04). The hop 826->1580 does not occur anywhere in [30001,34000] (step_31), so it either precedes the 1885->1572 event or lags it by far more than the 600-unit relay budget; the chain is broken at that link. The only remaining alternative (826->1485->254->14->1682->1045->1460) would need eight consecutive hops each within 600 units in a graph averaging under 4 events per node (steps 01,02), with no repeat traffic (repeat_ratio 0.017) to support it. The static connectivity (step_05) and the late-window activity bursts (steps 11,32) are confounders, not temporal evidence.\",\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_17\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_19\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_28\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_31\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_18\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_29\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_30\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_32\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ]\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 77310, "total_output_tokens": 9842, "total_tokens": 87152, "total_latency_ms": 136910, "llm_calls": 11, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}